name: Bounded general context through exact-file discovery, triage, report and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 planned | finite-context
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | context-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | context-complete
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | context-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-inactive-context
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-page-3
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 Filename list: 40 of 62 enumerated paths; 22 not listed here. | context-96x89
expect: Filename list: 40 of 62 enumerated paths; 22 not listed here.
expect: Complete repository coverage
expect: is not claimed.
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-40x12-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-40x12-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-40x12-page-3
ask: Are the architecture draft, bounded filename list, separate source limits and paging controls clear across all six sizes without implying that unlisted filenames or complete source coverage were supplied?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | context-result-return
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 Recorded Map is ready for review | recorded-map
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 SYSTEM SUMMARY | generated-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-context
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | accepted-summary
nav-mode:
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | source-diagram
expect: Declared source comments
keys: s
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | exact-scan-plan
expect: 1 exact source path
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 0
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | three-fixed-jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | scan-terms
expect: 3 fixed jobs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | reviewed-work
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-local-work
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | launch-separate
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | local-scan-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scanned
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | scan-complete
expect: Severity cutoff: not configured
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | source-origin
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | accepted-attempt
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | retained-observations
paste-file: @ART/open-finding.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 OWNER_POLICY_REVIEW | literal-observation
submit: decision deferred Owned source-only inventory fixture
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Evidence: 3 producer observations | consolidated-report
expect: 1 committed / 1 calls
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | selected-export
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | faithful-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the reviewed context bind exactly three approved app.py scans, with one shared consumed context request, three observations and an independent human deferral in the report?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Evidence: 3 producer observations | recovered-report
expect: 1 committed / 1 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/general_context_inventory.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact context, source, fixed work and spending without another request, scan or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
